          "designation": "(volume) magnetic susceptibility (χ)",
          "normativeStatus": "preferred"
        }
      ],
      "definitions": [
        {
          "content": "Measure of the ability of a medium to modify a magnetic field. It is related to the magnetic permeability by the relation μ / μ_0 = 1 + χ. The quantity μ / μ_0 is sometimes called relative permeability, μ_r."
        }
      ],
